    "chunk_text": "For Natural Glow \u2026\n\nWe all know beetroot is good for health, but this humble root is also a beauty secret our grandmothers swore by!\n\nPacked with antioxidants, iron, and vitamin C, beetroot gives you that rosy glow without any chemicals, so try these five easy homemade beetroot tips:\n\nMix 01 teaspoon beetroot juice and 01 teaspoon coconut oil and apply to lips before bed. Wash off in the morning.\n\nGives a natural pink stain and keeps lips soft and hydrated.\n\n: Mix 02 tablespoon grated beetroot, 01 tablespoon yoghurt, and 01 teaspoon honey.\n\nApply on clean face, let it stay for 15 minutes, and then rinse with cool water. Use twice a week.\n\nYoghurt cleanses, honey moisturises, while beetroot brings back that healthy pink glow.\n\nMix 01 tablespoon beetroot juice, 02 tablespoon sugar, and 01 teaspoon olive oil.\n\nApply and gently scrub face and neck, in circular motions, for 02 minutes, and then rinse.\n\nYou will need a cotton pad soaked in beetroot juice and a few drops of almond oil.\n\nAfter shampoo, pour over hair, leave for 10 minutes, then rinse.\n\nForensic Science: The silent guardian of justice in Sri Lanka\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
