    "description": "Delay in criminal justice system: 11-year-old victim waits 22 years  to testify in sexual abuse case",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Delay-in-criminal-justice-system-11-year-old-victim-waits-22-years-to-testify-in-sexual-abuse-case/108-345770",
