    "description": "SheTrades Hub launches Sinhala, Tamil export guides to help women-led SMEs tap UK market",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/SheTrades-Hub-launches-Sinhala-Tamil-export-guides-to-help-women-led-SMEs-tap-UK-market/34-794751",
