    "chunk_size_bytes": 1653,
    "chunk_text": "Ather showcases innovation at Colombo EV Motor Show 2026\n\nAther Energy, through its Sri Lankan distributor Evolution Auto, showcased strong momentum at the Colombo EV Motor Show 2026 with its premium electric scooter, the Ather 450X. The three-day event drew significant customer engagement, reinforcing the brand\u2019s reputation as the \u201csuper scooter\u201d in the local market.\n\nHighlighting its commitment to real-world riding needs, Ather introduced two new features to Sri Lanka: Infinite Cruise, which maintains consistent speed to reduce rider fatigue during long commutes, and Magic Twist, an intuitive regenerative braking system that allows riders to slow down by twisting the throttle backwards\u2014even bringing the scooter to a complete halt without using brake levers.\n\nVisitors also explored the scooter\u2019s connected technology and engineering, including a display of its battery pack and aluminium chassis. The positive feedback and strong interest underscore growing demand for premium EV solutions in Sri Lanka. Evolution Auto reaffirmed its dedication to expanding Ather\u2019s accessibility, inviting potential customers to experience the new features at local Experience Centres. As the country embraces sustainable mobility, Ather aims to play a pivotal role in shaping the future of electric commuting through innovation and customer-focused experiences.\n\nAA3 Holdings unveils Lanka\u2019s largest ex-stock heavy equipment showroom in Kiribathgoda\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
