    "chunk_text": "The conference will also recognise and appreciate the valuable support extended by the sponsors whose contributions have been instrumental in the successful organisation of this prestigious national event.\n\nThe technical sessions will be coordinated and introduced by University of Kelaniya Marketing Management Department Head and Senior Lecturer and Conference Committee Technical Committee Co-ordinator Dr. Sugeeth Patabendige.\n\nAs the Coordinator for Technical Sessions, Dr. Patabendige will brief the participants on the objectives, structure and key themes of the technical sessions, providing an overview of the discussions and highlighting their relevance to the current business environment.\n\nThe technical sessions will be held on day two of the conference.\n\nThe sessions will provide the participants with practical knowledge and insights into how the management accounting tools and techniques can support organisations in managing crises, achieving stability and driving sustainable growth.\n\nThe vote of thanks will be delivered by CMA Sri Lanka Vice President H.M. Hennayake Bandara, acknowledging the contributions of the speakers, delegates, sponsors, organising committees and all stakeholders who have supported the successful organisation of the conference."
