    "md5": "7cdec4e0e5b2cbbd6e1e122da87c1390",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1566,
    "chunk_text": "McLarens Lubricants wins \u2018Best Customer-Centric Supplier\u2019 award\n\nFrom left: Chatura Kaththriarachchi \u2013 Senior Manager Business Development, Upul Somaratne \u2013 General Manager Sales , Chaminda Gunarathne \u2013 Jt. Managing Director, Automobile Association representatives and Lahiru De Thabrew \u2013 Senior Manager Marketing.\n\nMcLarens Lubricants Limited has been recognized as the Best Customer-Centric Supplier at the Automobile Industry Awards 2026, organized by the Automobile Industry Council of Sri Lanka.\n\nMcLarens Lubricants received the accolade under the Supply Chain Industry category, reaffirming its commitment to delivering exceptional value, service excellence, and long-term partnerships across Sri Lanka\u2019s automotive sector.\n\nWith over 25 years of operations in Sri Lanka, McLarens Lubricants Limited has built a strong reputation for providing world-class lubrication and automotive solutions. McLarens Lubricants Limited represents globally popular brands including Mobil, recognized as the world\u2019s leading synthetic lubricant, and Lockheed Brake Fluids, a brand that has earned the trust of generations of Sri Lankan motorists.\n\nThe award recognizes McLarens Lubricants\u2019 unwavering focus on understanding customer needs, delivering superior products and services, and fostering lasting relationships with customers, distributors, workshops, and industry stakeholders. It also reflects the company\u2019s continued investment in operational excellence, innovation, and service quality, enabling it to consistently exceed customer expectations."
