    "date_str": "2026-07-20",
    "description": "JAT executes Mirotone acquisition roadmap with Australian re-entry",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/JAT-executes-Mirotone-acquisition-roadmap-with-Australian-re-entry/273-346141",
