    "chunk_text": "The initiative forms part of a broader, multifaceted programme launched by CA Sri Lanka and the CSE to support the development and growth of Sri Lanka\u2019s SME sector, which is widely recognised as a vital contributor to the national economy. The workshops addressed one of the key challenges faced by SMEs, namely limited access to finance, which continues to constrain the growth and expansion of many businesses.\n\nThe workshops also included tax updates relevant to SMEs and introduced participants to the SME Connect Awards and The Entrepreneur magazine. These initiatives form part of broader efforts to recognise excellence, promote good governance, and foster a culture of financial discipline and responsible business practices within Sri Lanka\u2019s SME sector."
