    "chunk_size_bytes": 671,
    "chunk_text": "He added that billions of rupees remained in unidentified or unresolved accounts because of poor integration between existing data systems, highlighting the need for a unified digital platform to improve service delivery.\n\nOnce completed, the committee\u2019s report will be released for public consultation and discussed with employees and the National Labour Consultative Council before any policy decisions are taken, he said.\n\nJayantha stressed the government\u2019s objective was to strengthen governance and maximise benefits for contributors while protecting workers\u2019 retirement savings, urging the public not to be misled by unverified information circulating online."
