    "description": "Cost pressures outweigh fuel price gains at Lanka IOC in\u00a01Q",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Cost-pressures-outweigh-fuel-price-gains-at-Lanka-IOC-in1Q/273-346260",
