    "chunk_text": "This is no longer just about mosquitoes. It is about mindset. Local councils must do better. That is non-negotiable. Waste management, drainage and public sanitation cannot be treated as secondary concerns. But the public must also change. Blame alone will not solve this problem.\n\nDengue is not an unbeatable disease. But it will not disappear on its own. It requires consistent effort from both the state and the people.\n\nThe question is whether we are finally ready to act before the next outbreak, or whether we will once again wait until it is too late."
