    "date_str": "2026-07-22",
    "description": "Sri Lankan brands don\u2019t have a sponsorship problem: They have an imagination problem",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Sri-Lankan-brands-don-t-have-a-sponsorship-problem-They-have-an-imagination-problem/4-794932",
