    "chunk_size_bytes": 1684,
    "chunk_text": "HNB Life extends wings into digital future with new mobile app\n\nHNB Life celebrating 25 years of protecting lives and being there for Sri Lankans through every stage of life, launched the HNB Life Mobile App recently.\n\nBuilt around the Company\u2019s new brand philosophy, \u201cWings for Life,\u201d the mobile app reflects HNB Life\u2019s purpose of empowering customers with protection and the freedom to thrive, no matter where life takes them. The app is designed to make life easier for customers by giving them quick and convenient access to their policy information anytime, anywhere, right at their fingertips.\n\nThrough the app, customers can easily access policy details, stay updated on their information, make requests, and connect with HNB Life in a much more seamless and convenient way.\n\nSpeaking about the launch of the app, Lasitha Wimalaratne, Executive Director / Chief Executive Officer of HNB Life PLC stated, \u201cAt HNB Life, everything we do is centered around making life easier and better for our customers. As we celebrate our 25th year, the launch of the HNB Life Mobile App is another important step forward in delivering on our purpose of empowering lives with protection and the freedom to thrive. We want our customers to have their policy information available at their fingertips, whenever they need it.\u201d\n\nOver the past few years, HNB Life has continued to make significant investments in technology and digital transformation to enhance the customer journey. This includes upgrading and modernizing its core systems, integrating AI-powered capabilities, and launching HANA, the Company\u2019s chatbot designed to offer customers faster and more convenient support."
  },
