    "chunk_text": "The Mirigama and Galagedara branches will offer the full spectrum of LOLC Finance\u2019s services, including savings and fixed deposits, leasing facilities, business and personal loans, gold loans, SME financing, digital financial solutions and a range of value-added financial services designed to cater to the diverse needs of customers.\n\nThe Galagedara branch was ceremonially declared open in the presence of LOLC Finance Head of Gold Loan Nishantha Jayasekara and LOLC Finance Head of SME and Personal Finance Charith Jagoda, along with the distinguished guests, customers and the members of the local community.\n\nWith one of the largest branch networks among Sri Lanka\u2019s NBFIs, LOLC Finance continues to invest in expanding its physical presence alongside its growing suite of digital financial solutions, enabling the customers to enjoy seamless and convenient banking experiences through multiple channels.\n\nBacked by decades of industry leadership, financial strength and customer trust, LOLC Finance remains committed to delivering innovative, accessible and responsible financial services while contributing to the country\u2019s sustainable economic growth."
