    "chunk_text": "Speaker, MP clash verbally over raising of questions\n\nColombo, July 23 (Daily Mirror) - Speaker Jagath Wickramaratne engaged in a verbal clash with MP Chanaka Madugoda during which the former accused the MP of taking too much time on questions.\n\nHe also clashed with MP Ramanathan Archuna as well over raising questions.\n\nMP Madugoda then proposed that answers for oral questions be submitted by the relevant Minister before the sessions, so that there will be enough time for supplimentary questions."
