    "chunk_size_bytes": 1582,
    "chunk_text": "LB Finance: Leading Sri Lanka\u2019s ESG Journey\n\nSustainability is no longer simply a corporate aspiration; it has become a defining measure of resilience, investor confidence and long-term value creation. As Environmental, Social and Governance (ESG) expectations continue to reshape the global financial landscape, financial institutions are increasingly expected to deliver positive environmental and social outcomes alongside strong financial performance.\n\nFor LB Finance PLC, sustainability is not a recent addition to its strategy. It is a commitment that has been built steadily over more than a decade, evolving through innovation, responsible finance and internationally recognised ESG leadership.\n\nAs one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading Non-Banking Financial Institutions (NBFIs), LB Finance has woven ESG into the fabric of its corporate strategy, recognising the industry\u2019s responsibility to support sustainable economic growth. Guided by its ESG Pathway, the Company recently introduced ESG Roadmap 2.0, setting ambitious targets through to 2030 across three strategic ESG pillars. More than a roadmap, it provides a clear direction for climate action, responsible finance, social impact and governance excellence, ensuring sustainability remains central to every major decision while supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s broader sustainable development agenda.\n\nThis commitment has earned international recognition through an AAA ESG Rating from IdealRatings, reinforcing the Company\u2019s alignment with globally recognised sustainability frameworks and strengthening investor confidence."
  },
