    "chunk_text": "Invest Lab celebrates 5 years with Right Vantage Corporate Solutions launch\n\nInvest Lab Managing Director and founder Karen Rubera joins Invest Lab Director Operations at anniversary cake cutting ceremony\u00a0PIX BY WARUNA WANNIARCHCHI\n\nMarking a significant milestone in its growth trajectory, global remote services provider Invest Lab Business Solutions recently celebrated its fifth anniversary alongside the launch of its new domestic arm Right Vantage Corporate Solutions.\n\n\u200bThe new entity aims to cater to the growing local demand for integrated corporate support services, positioning itself as a single trusted partner for Sri Lankan businesses.\n\n\u200bDelivering a keynote address at the event, held in Colombo recently, Hemas Centre of Excellence Finance Services General Manager Chamila Cooray detailed the company\u2019s remarkable five-year journey. She noted that Invest Lab was established in May 2021, under a fully remote model, initially operating with just a single client and a laptop.\n\n\u200bDrawing a parallel to the growth of a Chinese bamboo tree, Cooray highlighted the patient, long-term approach the founders took to build deep operational roots. She observed that the company navigated late nights, hard decisions and continuous learning to scale its capacity.\n\nBy focusing on building client trust one relationship at a time, Invest Lab steadily expanded its global footprint, providing specialised remote support in legal, accounting and construction-related services to an international clientele.\n\n\u200bCooray also praised the founders, Karen Rubera and Gayan Senanayake, pointing out that their shared background as Chartered Accountants brings a rare combination of precision and courage to the enterprise, resulting in a business built to last."
  },
