    "chunk_text": "Over the past 45 years, Janashakthi Finance has evolved alongside Sri Lanka\u2019s economic landscape, continuously strengthening its products, services, and customer experience to address emerging financial needs. Through its comprehensive portfolio of financial solutions, expanding reach, and relationship-driven approach, the company has enabled thousands of Sri Lankans to pursue personal aspirations, grow businesses, and create new opportunities.\n\nThe company\u2019s commitment to excellence has also been recognised through several industry accolades over the years. Janashakthi Finance has received recognition at the CA Sri Lanka TAGS Awards in 2024 and 2025, the IFFSA Awards in 2024, and the 10th International Islamic Finance Forum South Asia (IFFSA) Awards 2025, the SLIBFI Awards 2024, the 11th CMA Excellence in Integrated Reporting Awards, the SLIM DIGIS 2.5 Awards 2025, the Effie Awards Sri Lanka 2025, and the Best Management Practices Company Awards 2025. These recognitions highlight the institution\u2019s progress in areas including governance, integrated reporting, marketing effectiveness, digital engagement, financial inclusion, and responsible business practices.\n\nRajendra Theagarajah, Chairman of Janashakthi Finance, reflected on the milestone, stating, \u201cOver the years, we have strengthened our position by placing customers at the centre of our decisions while maintaining high standards of governance, financial discipline, and responsible growth. As Sri Lanka progresses towards greater economic opportunities, we remain committed to supporting individuals, entrepreneurs, and businesses through accessible and relevant financial solutions that contribute to national growth.\u201d"
