    "chunk_text": "Debate on no-confidence motion on Justice Minister Harshana Nanayakkara underway\n\nColombo, July 24 (Daily Mirror)- The debate on the no confidence motion on Justice Minister Harshana Nanayakkara got underway in Parliament a short while ago.\n\nThe motion was moved by MP Ajith P. Perera in the House today."
