    "description": "President\u2019s timely intervention secures 10% US tariff rate, says Mahinda Samarasinghe",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Presidents-timely-intervention-secures-10-US-tariff-rate-says-Mahinda-Samarasinghe/108-346516",
    "lang": "en",
