    "chunk_size_bytes": 742,
    "chunk_text": "New Chairman and members appointed to Delimitation Commission\n\nColombo, July 24 (Daily Mirror) - President Anura Kumara Dissanayake has appointed M. K. Saman Sri Ratnayake as the new Chairman and a member of the Delimitation Commission.\n\nAccording to the President\u2019s Media Division (PMD), M. B. Rohana Pushpakumara and K. Thavalingam have been appointed as the other members of the Commission.\n\nThe letters of appointment were handed over to the newly appointed officials by Secretary to the President Dr Nandika Sanath Kumanayake at the Presidential Secretariat this afternoon (24).\n\nThe appointments were made to fill vacancies that arose following the expiry of the terms of office of the previous members of the Delimitation Commission."
