    "chunk_text": "Four arrested over shooting at Wattala birthday party\n\nColombo, July 24 (Daily Mirror) - Four suspects, including two women, have been arrested for allegedly aiding and abetting the fatal shooting that occurred in the Palliyawatta area of Kadirana, Wattala.\n\nAccording to Police Media Spokesman Assistant Superintendent of Police F.U. Wootler, the suspects will be produced before the Fort Magistrate\u2019s Court to obtain detention orders to facilitate further investigations.\n\nHe also said that five police teams have been deployed to investigate the shooting.\n\nThe incident occurred yesterday (23) when a gunman opened fire at a child\u2019s birthday party in Palliyawatta, Wattala, killing a 39-year-old man.\n\nAccording to police, the shooting was allegedly aimed at a suspected drug trafficker known as \u201cKudu Roshan\u201d from Mattakkuliya. However, the gunman is believed to have missed the intended target and fatally shot a 39-year-old bystander who was standing nearby."
