    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s competitive edge: Intellectual Property Rights and the power of Geographical Indications",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/sri-lankas-competitive-edge-intellectual-property-rights-and-the-power-of-geographical-indications/",
    "lang": "en",
