    "chunk_text": "ESOL Premier Campus launches OCN London qualifications in Sri Lanka\n\nAmali Jayasinghe, Director \u2013 ESOL Premier Campus; Himantha Karunarathne, Director \u2013 ESOL Premier Campus; Carlos Cubillo-Barsi, Chief Executive Officer \u2013 OCN London; Premila Paulraj, Regional Head \u2013 South Asia, OCN London; and Andrew Abinash, General Manager \u2013 ESOL Premier Campus, at the official launch of the exclusive partnership\n\nOffering local students and professionals, access to world-renowned UK-accredited qualifications, ESOL Premier Campus has officially launched OCN London qualifications in Sri Lanka through an exclusive partnership with the UK awarding organisation.\u00a0 In operation since the 1970s, OCN London is a recognised UK Awarding Organisation regulated by Ofqual UK. ESOL Premier Campus is an established education provider with a track record of delivering universally recognisedprogrammes.\n\nThis provides an opportunity to gain globally accepted, Ofqual-regulated qualifications in English, Business Management, Education and Training, and Digital Marketing without having to travel abroad, while enhancing academic and career prospects.\n\nElaborating further, Andrew Abinash, General Manager of ESOL Premier Campus said, \u201cWe are delighted to introduce OCN London qualifications to Sri Lanka through ESOL Premier Campus, creating new opportunities for learners to access internationally accepted UK qualifications without the need to travel overseas.\u201d"
  },
