    "chunk_text": "Elaborating further, Andrew Abinash, General Manager of ESOL Premier Campus said, \u201cWe are delighted to introduce OCN London qualifications to Sri Lanka through ESOL Premier Campus, creating new opportunities for learners to access internationally accepted UK qualifications without the need to travel overseas.\u201d\n\nThe OCN London portfolio offered through ESOL Premier Campus includes OCN London ESOL International qualifications at CEFR B1, B2, C1 and C2 levels, the OCN London Level 4 Certificate in Education and Training, the Level 3 Certificate in Principles of Business Administration, the Level 4 Diploma and Level 5 Diploma in Business Management, as well as the Level 4 Certificate and Level 4 Diploma in Digital Marketing. These qualifications have been developed in accordance with international academic and professional standards and are designed to support progression into higher education and employment opportunities."
