    "description": "Citi Global Community Day initiative supports Mawela Kanishta Vidyalaya",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Citi-Global-Community-Day-initiative-supports-Mawela-Kanishta-Vidyalaya/273-346578",
