    "description": "Arcasia, ATX move to take control of Industrial Asphalts",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Arcasia-ATX-move-to-take-control-of-Industrial-Asphalts/273-346583",
    "lang": "en",
