    "description": "Navigating Sri Lanka\u2019s post-disaster recovery: Missed opportunities or squandered chances",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/news-features/Navigating-Sri-Lankas-post-disaster-recovery-Missed-opportunities-or-squandered-chances/131-346599",
    "lang": "en",
