    "chunk_text": "Shashi Tharoor, Ranil meet\n\nCelebrated speaker, author, writer and Member of Parliament Dr. Shashi Tharoor met with former President Ranil Wickremesinghe yesterday to exchange views on India\u2013Sri Lanka relations and broader regional cooperation. Dr. Tharoor was in Colombo as the Chief Guest at the Colombo Literary Festival."
