    "md5": "740e4663c07a037c2d9f113e99b049b8",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1535,
    "chunk_text": "As part of the collaboration, these services offered by Abans Environmental Services are now available for booking through the Kapruka platform. Customers can access sofa cleaning services, carpet shampooing services, apartment cleaning services, house cleaning services, and pest control services, providing households with convenient access to trusted, professional-grade cleaning and maintenance solutions through a familiar online marketplace.\n\nThe partnership will continue to expand, with floor cleaning services and glass cleaning services confirmed for introduction on the platform in the coming phase.\n\nFounded in 2002 by entrepreneur Dulith V. Herath, Kapruka Holdings PLC has grown into Sri Lanka\u2019s leading e-commerce platform, offering online shopping, gifting, logistics, global shopping, and digital marketplace services to customers locally and internationally. Through continuous innovation and strategic partnerships, Kapruka has expanded its marketplace beyond retail products to include a growing portfolio of professional services.\n\nThe collaboration between Abans Environmental Services and Kapruka reflects the increasing demand for trusted, professionally managed home and commercial services delivered through convenient digital platforms. By combining ABANS\u2019 decades of operational expertise with Kapruka\u2019s nationwide digital reach, the partnership aims to simplify access to reliable environmental and facility management solutions while supporting the continued growth of Sri Lanka\u2019s digital economy."
