    "chunk_text": "Fly A World Consultants and Tourism recognised for excellence in travel consultancy\n\nFly A World Consultants and Tourism (Pvt) Ltd has been honoured with the Excellence in Travel Consultancy Services Award in the Small Scale Services Sector at the Honor of Business Talent 2026, recognising the company\u2019s outstanding contribution to Sri Lanka\u2019s travel and tourism industry. The award celebrates organisations that demonstrate excellence in customer service, business performance, and professional standards. It highlights Fly A World\u2019s commitment to providing reliable, personalised, and high-quality travel solutions for both leisure and business travellers. Founded by M. C. M. Shahood, Founder and Director, Fly A World Consultants and Tourism has established itself as a trusted name in the travel industry. The company is a Civil Aviation Authority of Sri Lanka licensed travel agency (Air Transport Licence \u2013 Group 6(A), Passenger Transport, Licence No. A-1642), a registered member of the Sri Lanka Tourism Development Authority (SLTDA), and a member of the Travel Agents Association of Sri Lanka (TAASL), demonstrating its commitment to maintaining the highest industry standards.\n\nSri Lanka Insurance Life awards 227 scholarships under Suba Pathum programme\n\nThree Sinha Industries named Sustainability Business Leader of the Year\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
