    "chunk_text": "Hotel Show Colombo showcases hospitality industry offerings\n\nThe 18th Hotel Show Colombo concluded at the BMICH, showcasing a range of products, services and brands catering to Sri Lanka\u2019s hospitality sector.\n\nThe three-day exhibition was inaugurated by Deputy Tourism Minister Prof. Ruwan Ranasinghe, alongside New Zealand High Commissioner David Pine, Vietnamese Ambassador Trinh Thi Tam and hospitality industry representatives."
