    "md5": "999de4a2d65e52940c16010c1b80f38f",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1570,
    "chunk_text": "Pussalla Agri Ventures wins Sustainable Agriculture Infrastructure Award\n\nPussalla Agri Ventures (Pvt.) Ltd has been honoured with the Sustainable Agriculture Infrastructure Award, at the prestigious Sri Lankan Sustainability Awards 2026, recognising the company\u2019s outstanding commitment to sustainable agriculture, environmental stewardship and responsible organic cinnamon production.\n\nThe award, presented at the grand ceremony held at The Hilton Colombo and organised by the Ceylon Institute of Builders, recognises the organisations that have demonstrated excellence in integrating sustainability into their core business operations while contributing to Sri Lanka\u2019s sustainable development agenda.\n\nThe recognition highlights Pussalla Agri Ventures\u2019 holistic approach to sustainable agriculture, where environmentally responsible farming practices are combined with internationally recognised quality and food safety standards.\n\nThe company has established an integrated value chain encompassing cinnamon cultivation, harvesting, processing, value addition and packaging, ensuring complete traceability and consistent product quality from farm to finished product.\n\nCommitted to protecting natural ecosystems, Pussalla Agri Ventures implements responsible agricultural practices focused on soil conservation, biodiversity protection, efficient resource utilisation and the elimination of prohibited synthetic chemicals. These initiatives support the long-term sustainability of agricultural production while preserving the environment for future generations."
  },
