    "description": "Police recommend removing Kavadi segment from Devinuwara Perahera over security concerns",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Police-recommend-removing-Kavadi-segment-from-Devinuwara-Perahera-over-security-concerns/56-795199",
    "lang": "en",
