    "chunk_text": "Gunmen riding a motorcycle opened fire at a house in the Neboda, Matugama on July 11, although no injuries were reported.\n\nA suspected drug trafficker snatched a traffic police officer's service firearm and shot at him during a narcotics raid in Katunayake on July 15. The officer was injured.\n\nA 56-year-old security guard was shot and injured on July 19 inside the \"Nisala Sewana\" Dehiwala\u2013Mount Lavinia public cemetery.\n\nA 24-year-old suspect was shot and injured by police in Bokundara, Piliyandala on July 19 when he attempted to assault the officers with a sword.\n\nUnidentified gunmen travelling in a car opened several rounds of fire on a fisherman's home in Devinuwara on July 21. No injuries were reported.\n\nThe house of a police sergeant came under gunfire in the Walawala area of Beliatta on the night of Wednesday, July 22. The officer and family members escaped without injury.\n\nA 39-year-old man was shot dead during a child's birthday party at a function hall in the Palliyawatta area of Wattala on the night of Thursday, on July 23\n\nA shooting incident near the Kuppiyawatta cemetery in Dematagoda left one man seriously injured on July 23.\n\nA 55-year-old restaurant owner was fatally shot near the entrance to the Bellanwila walking track along the Dehiwala\u2013Boralesgamuwa Road on July 25.\n\nTwo Sri Lankans suspected in Wattala shooting detained in India"
