    "chunk_text": "The Office Bearers for the 2026/27 term are Chairperson Sampath Jayasundara, Director/CEO of hSenid Business Solutions; Vice Chairperson 1 Haridhu Abeygoonaratne, Managing Director of SimCentric Technologies; Vice Chairperson 2 Sanjini Munaweera, Regional Head South Asia \u2013 Customer Engagement Solutions at ADA; Director Finance Bimal Gunapala, VP Engineering at Global Frontiers; and Director Operations Shanaka Fernando, Managing Director/Country Head of WNS Sri Lanka. The newly appointed Board Directors, includes Thilanka Jayathilake, VP Human Resources at IFS R&D International; Denver De Zylva, Co-Country Head at Virtusa; Zahra Cader, ESG, Government and Public Sector Leader at Deloitte; Omar Hassen, Country Lead at HCL Tech; Tharindra Jayamaha, Director Quality at 99x; Thushera Kawdawatte, Managing Director at Sysco LABS; and Arjuna Amarasinghe, Director/Representative at Covalent Systems."
