    "chunk_text": "JXG featured as an official TikTok for Business Case Study\n\nMembers of the JXG leadership team, together with the JXG Marketing team and representatives from Aleph, TikTok\u2019s authorised sales partner in Sri Lanka\n\nJXG (Janashakthi Group) has become the first financial conglomerate in the country to be featured as an official TikTok for Business Case Study.\n\nThe recognition highlights the Group\u2019s \u201cWho is JXG?\u201d corporate brand and IPO campaign, an integrated marketing campaign that combined multiple communication channels, with digital platforms playing a key role in building awareness, strengthening engagement and driving measurable outcomes ahead of its Initial Public Offering (IPO).\n\nThe recognition was presented by Aleph, TikTok\u2019s authorized sales partner in Sri Lanka. Aleph is a global leader in digital advertising solutions, connecting leading digital platforms with advertisers worldwide.\n\nThe case study highlights how the Group leveraged TikTok\u2019s advertising solutions as part of its broader integrated marketing approach to introduce JXG as the corporate identity bringing together its established businesses, while creating awareness and understanding of the Group ahead of its Rs.5 billion IPO.\n\nThe campaign was built around the central question, \u201cWho is JXG?\u201d, and adopted a multi-channel approach supported by targeted digital engagement. TikTok played a key role in extending the campaign\u2019s reach and connecting with audiences through platform-relevant content formats. The digital strategy was executed through a two-phased approach.\n\nThe first phase focused on maximizing reach, attention, and message retention through six-second Video View campaigns, driving broad awareness of the IPO. The second phase leveraged Smart Traffic optimisation to encourage high-intent audiences to visit the IPO landing page, moving them from awareness to consideration."
  },
