    "chunk_text": "The first phase focused on maximizing reach, attention, and message retention through six-second Video View campaigns, driving broad awareness of the IPO. The second phase leveraged Smart Traffic optimisation to encourage high-intent audiences to visit the IPO landing page, moving them from awareness to consideration.\n\nCommenting on the recognition, Gamika de Silva, Group Chief Marketing Officer JXG said,\n\n\u201cBeing featured as an official TikTok for Business Case Study is an important recognition of JXG\u2019s commitment to innovation, creativity and marketing excellence. The \u2018Who is JXG?\u2019 campaign was designed as an integrated brand-building initiative to introduce our corporate identity and create meaningful connections with our audiences. Digital platforms, including TikTok, played an important role in amplifying our message, enabling us to engage audiences at scale and generate measurable outcomes during a significant milestone in our growth journey.\u201d\n\nThis recognition reflects JXG\u2019s continued focus on adopting innovative communication strategies and global best practices to strengthen brand relevance in an evolving financial landscape. Guided by its purpose of \u201cBreaking Barriers, Forging Futures,\u201d JXG continues to leverage new platforms, insights and ideas to deepen engagement with Sri Lankan audiences and shape the future of financial services in the country."
