    "md5": "d0f72ecc388908ebdae104c55dcb151f",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1608,
    "chunk_text": "CSE Clear marks 1st anniversary\n\nCSE Clear (Private) Limited celebrates its first anniversary today, marking a significant milestone in the evolution of Sri Lanka\u2019s capital market.\n\nEstablished as the country\u2019s first Central Counterparty (CCP), CSE Clear, a fully-owned subsidiary of the CSE, has successfully completed its inaugural year of operations, reinforcing market resilience, enhancing settlement efficiency and strengthening investor confidence through international best practices in clearing and settlement.\n\nSince commencing operations, CSE Clear has played a pivotal role in mitigating counterparty risk by interposing itself between the buyers and sellers, ensuring the integrity of post-trade processes and providing greater certainty in regard to settlements to market participants. The successful implementation of the CCP model represents one of the most significant reforms in Sri Lanka\u2019s securities market in recent decades, aligning the country\u2019s post-trade infrastructure with globally accepted standards.\n\nDuring its first year, CSE Clear successfully facilitated the clearing and settlement of equity market transactions with high operational reliability while maintaining robust risk management practices. The organisation established a comprehensive margining framework, introduced a Contributory Guarantee Fund to strengthen default management capabilities and advanced risk monitoring to safeguard market stability under a wide range of market conditions. And successfully cleared and settled Rs.1,188 billion worth of transactions through more than eight million trades."
  },
