    "description": "Who carries the weight, and why is it time to share",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Who-carries-the-weight-and-why-is-it-time-to-share/4-795217",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
