    "description": "SJB, Govt. trade barbs over BASL amid judges\u2019 retirement age controversy",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/SJB-Govt-trade-barbs-over-BASL-amid-judges-retirement-age-controversy/56-795269",
    "lang": "en",
