    "chunk_text": "The immediate past chairman of the Colombo Brokers\u2019 Association will continue to serve as an ex-officio member, ensuring continuity and broad industry representation.\n\nThe association also confirmed the appointment of KPMG as the auditor and Corporate Services (Pvt.) Ltd as the company secretary for the 2026/27 term.\n\nAs the CTTA embarks on its 133rd year, the association reaffirmed its commitment to working closely with the government, regulators, producers, exporters, brokers, buyers and all industry stakeholders to safeguard the integrity of the Colombo Tea Auction, promote sustainable industry reforms, accelerate value-added exports and strengthen the global standing of the iconic Ceylon Tea brand."
