    "description": "A taste of Yaal plated in Colombo",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/A-taste-of-Yaal-plated-in-Colombo/273-346851",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1785266528.0,
