    "description": "SLASSCOM calls for stronger academia - industry collaboration to build future-ready talent",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/SLASSCOM-calls-for-stronger-academia-industry-collaboration-to-build-future-ready-talent/273-346852",
