    "chunk_size_bytes": 914,
    "chunk_text": "Sajith meets outgoing Chinese Ambassador\n\nOpposition Leader Sajith Premadasa (right) with outgoing Chinese Ambassador Qi Zhenhong\n\nOpposition Leader Sajith Premadasa on Monday met outgoing Chinese Ambassador Qi Zhenhong at the Opposition Leader\u2019s Office in Colombo.\n\nAccording to the Opposition Leader\u2019s Office, Premadasa thanked Ambassador Qi for his contribution to strengthening diplomatic relations between Sri Lanka and China during his tenure.\n\nThe discussions focused on maintaining long-term bilateral relations, including cooperation in economic development, investment, trade and development assistance. Both sides also underscored the importance of continued engagement between the two countries.\n\nPremadasa extended his best wishes to Ambassador Qi for his future endeavours and reaffirmed the importance of sustaining a constructive and mutually beneficial partnership between Sri Lanka and China."
