    "description": "Quiet diplomacy of Ambassador Qi Zhenhong: Through crisis and recovery",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Quiet-diplomacy-of-Ambassador-Qi-Zhenhong-Through-crisis-and-recovery/4-795302",
