    "md5": "8130a2d8a8d89b70bb660e0755673014",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 805,
    "chunk_text": "Three Sinha Industries wins Gold Award at INCO 2026\n\nThree Sinha Industries (Pvt) Ltd was recognised with the\u00a0 Gold Award for the \u2018Best Stall with Locally Assembled Products\u2019 at the INCO 2026 Premier Industrial Exhibition organised by the Institution of Incorporated Engineers, Sri Lanka (IIESL).\n\nThe award was presented in recognition of the company\u2019s outstanding exhibition presence, commitment to local manufacturing, and contribution towards promoting Sri Lankan-made industrial and engineering products.\n\nThe INCO Exhibition, held annually at the Bandaranaike Memorial International Conference Hall (BMICH), is regarded as one of the country\u2019s leading industrial exhibitions, bringing together manufacturers, engineers, technology providers, and industry stakeholders from across Sri Lanka."
  },
  {
