    "description": "Siddhalepa honoured with GlobalHealth Sri Lanka Awards 2026",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Siddhalepa-honoured-with-GlobalHealth-Sri-Lanka-Awards-2026/273-346889",
