    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "8c07bd413ddf62e39978e88638273679",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1861,
    "chunk_text": "Siddhalepa honoured with GlobalHealth Sri Lanka Awards 2026\n\nSiddhalepa Ayurveda product range and Siddhalepa Ayurveda Health Resort have been honoured with two accolades at the inaugural GlobalHealth Asia-Pacific Sri Lanka Conference & Awards 2026.\n\nSiddhalepa Ayurveda products received the \u201cExcellence in Herbal Wellness & Functional Nutrition in Sri Lanka\u201d award, while Siddhalepa Ayurveda Health Resort was recognised as the \u2018Holistic Health & Wellness Service Provider of the Year in Sri Lanka.\u2019\n\nThe awards were presented during the GlobalHealth Sri Lanka Awards ceremony held at ITC Ratnadipa, Colombo, on 21 July.\n\nGlobalHealth Asia-Pacific is a premier regional platform dedicated to connecting healthcare providers, aesthetic centres, wellness destinations, and policymakers across more than 14 countries. The GlobalHealth Sri Lanka Awards celebrate organisations that uphold the highest standards of professional practice, ethical governance, service excellence, and patient-centred innovation.\n\nFrom its origins in Sri Lanka over 90 years ago, Siddhalepa Ayurveda products have grown into a globally recognised representation of Sri Lankan Ayurveda. Trusted by generations and embraced internationally, the product range continues to carry Sri Lanka\u2019s healing heritage beyond its shores, offering natural healthcare solutions that have become part of everyday lifestyles around the world.\n\nComplementing this achievement, Siddhalepa Ayurveda Health Resort was honoured with the \u201cHolistic Health & Wellness Service Provider of the Year in Sri Lanka\u201d award.\n\nCommenting on the achievement, Asoka Hettigoda, Chairman and Managing Director of Siddhalepa Group said, \u201cThese recognitions reaffirm our commitment to preserving the authenticity of Sri Lankan Ayurveda while ensuring its benefits continue to reach people in meaningful ways."
  },
