    "chunk_size_bytes": 1799,
    "chunk_text": "Adding to its versatility, CAMON 50 Pro introduces advanced underwater photography, enabling users to capture stunning photos and videos even in challenging conditions with Aqua Mode. Combined with IP68/IP69K Water and Dust Resistance, the device is built to perform wherever life takes you.\n\nTECNO CAMON 50 Pro also features a powerful 50MP Sony LYT-700C Ultra Night Camera, designed to deliver exceptional performance in low light. With a large 1/1.56\u201d sensor and f/1.8 aperture, users can capture brighter, clearer images even at night.\n\nEnhanced with Optical Image Stabilisation and advanced pixel technology, the camera ensures stable, detailed shots across both photography and videography. A 50MP telephoto lens enables professional portrait shots, while an 8MP Ultra-wide Angle camera allows users to capture more in every frame.\n\nTECNO CAMON 50 Pro delivers an immersive experience with its 6.78-inch curved AMOLED display, featuring 1.5K resolution and a 144Hz refresh rate for vibrant, ultra-smooth visuals. Sleek and lightweight in design, it is available in Moonshadow Black, Nebula Titanium and Malachite Green.\n\nPowered by the MediaTek Helio G200 Ultimate processor with up to 16GB RAM (including extended RAM) and 256GB storage, the device ensures fast, seamless performance, while a 6500mAh battery with 45W fast charging supports all-day use.\n\nEnhanced by TECNO AI, the smartphone brings intelligent photography, creative tools and everyday convenience together in one powerful, easy-to-use experience.\n\nTECNO CAMON 50 Pro is now available across Sri Lanka through authorised TECNO retailers and leading mobile stores islandwide. Priced at Rs.159,999, the smartphone brings together advanced camera capabilities, AI-powered features and a premium design experience for consumers."
