    "description": "Saving Seconds, Saving Lives:  The Sri Lankan Doctor Behind a Life-Saving Invention",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/hard-talk/Saving-Seconds-Saving-Lives-The-Sri-Lankan-Doctor-Behind-a-Life-Saving-Invention/334-346908",
