    "language": "en",
    "md5": "c5f5c386f2dd68975eba2b7a2b67c4d0",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1652,
    "chunk_text": "Saving Seconds, Saving Lives:  The Sri Lankan Doctor Behind a Life-Saving Invention\n\nSri Lankan Anaesthetist Dr. Kumaru Wijeratne Develops the Pocket-Sized Rapid Intubation Detector to Instantly Confirm\u00a0Airway Placement\u00a0 and Save Critical Lives Worldwide\n\n\u201cIn anaesthesiology, every second is precious because it can determine a patient\u2019s life. If I can save those few precious seconds, I will consider my journey worthwhile.\u201d\n\n\u201cProfessor Archie Brain noted that this simple approach has the potential to overcome the practical limitations of gold-standard capnography used worldwide.\u201d\n\nProf. Dr. Archie Brain (Left) and Dr. Kumaru wijeratne (Right) at WAMM \u2013 2025 Florance, Italy\n\nIn emergency medicine and surgery, confirming proper endotracheal tube placement is a matter of life and death. Traditional gold-standard capnography takes roughly 30 seconds and carries risks of gastric inflation or delayed detection. Dr. Kumaru Wijeratne, an anaesthetist at the National Hospital of Sri Lanka, has spent five years developing a ground-breaking solution: the Rapid Intubation Detector (RID). By measuring tissue resistance differences between the trachea and esophagus, this compact, affordable device confirms correct positioning in under one second without artificial ventilation. Internationally patented and acclaimed by leading global experts, Dr. Wijeratne\u2019s invention promises to revolutionize emergency airway management worldwide.\n\nI am an old boy of Nalanda College, Colombo. After completing my secondary education, I entered the Faculty of Medicine (Ragama), University of Kelaniya, where I obtained my first medical degree."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
    "doc_id": "2026-07-29-dailymirrorlk-f84a7a59",
    "num": "dailymirrorlk-f84a7a59",
    "date_str": "2026-07-29",
    "description": "Saving Seconds, Saving Lives:  The Sri Lankan Doctor Behind a Life-Saving Invention",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/hard-talk/Saving-Seconds-Saving-Lives-The-Sri-Lankan-Doctor-Behind-a-Life-Saving-Invention/334-346908",
