    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s direct\u2013indirect tax imbalance:  Is revenue success coming at expense of tax equity?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Sri-Lanka-s-directindirect-tax-imbalance-Is-revenue-success-coming-at-expense-of-tax-equity/4-795339",
    "lang": "en",
