    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s innovation gap is no longer about ideas; it is about execution",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Sri-Lanka-s-innovation-gap-is-no-longer-about-ideas-it-is-about-execution/14-795340",
    "lang": "en",
