    "description": "BASL passes unanimous resolution opposing judges\u2019 retirement age amendment, cites lack of consultation",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/BASL-passes-unanimous-resolution-opposing-judges-retirement-age-amendment-cites-lack-of-consultation/56-795353",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
