    "chunk_text": "Palitha Bandara wins Sri Lanka\u2019s first medal at 2026 Commonwealth Games\n\nColombo, July 30 (Daily Mirror) - Sri Lanka\u2019s Palitha Bandara secured the country\u2019s first medal at the 2026 Commonwealth Games after claiming silver in the men\u2019s discus throw F42-44/F61-64 para athletics final.\n\nThe silver medal marks Bandara\u2019s second consecutive Commonwealth Games podium finish in the event, having also claimed silver at the Birmingham 2022 Commonwealth Games."
