    "chunk_size_bytes": 266,
    "chunk_text": "President attends Kataragama Esala Perahera\n\nThe final grand procession of the 2026 Esala Perahera of the historic Ruhunu Kataragama Maha Devalaya was held last night, with President Anura Kumara Dissanayake joining thousands of devotees to witness the sacred event."
