    "chunk_size_bytes": 270,
    "chunk_text": "Ranil visits Bhutan\n\nColombo, July 30 (Daily Mirror) - Former President Ranil Wickremesinghe is currently in Bhutan on a private visit, a spokesman from his office said today.\n\nWickremesinghe left for Bhutan on Monday and is expected to return on Sunday, August 2, 2026."
