    "chunk_text": "Sugeeshwara Bandara further remanded\n\nColombo, July 30 (Daily Mirror) - The Colombo Fort Magistrate\u2019s Court today ordered former President Gotabaya Rajapaksa's former Private Secretary, Sugeeshwara Lenin Bandara, to be further remanded till August 12 over allegations of criminal misappropriation of funds allocated under the Presidential Expenditure Head."
