    "chunk_text": "Jerome Fernando meets followers in Australia\n\nJuly 30 (Daily Mirror) - Jerome Fernando, more popularly known as \u2018Prophet Jerome\u2019 amongst his followers, undertook a visit to Australia recently, where he led several services and prayers for his Australian and international followers."
