    "chunk_text": "However, it said the government had failed to initiate such a broader constitutional reform process despite previous commitments, and instead had chosen to pursue an amendment on an issue that was not part of recent constitutional reform discussions or election campaigns.\n\nThe Church further said the leadership of the Executive, Legislature and Judiciary should examine the reasons behind what it called a \u201csudden, ad hoc and ad hominem\u201d constitutional amendment.\n\nIt also criticised political leaders who, according to the Church, advocate for independent institutions while in opposition but later introduce policies that promote executive convenience and self-interest once they assume power.\n\nThe Church of Ceylon urged the President and the government to withdraw the proposed constitutional amendment."
