    "md5": "0bcf09aad1404598ad04f45f92de49af",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1736,
    "chunk_text": "AMW opens Kandy Suzuki showroom\n\nAssociated Motorways (Private) Limited (AMW), an Al-Futtaim company and the sole authorised distributor for the Suzuki vehicles in Sri Lanka, has further strengthened its nationwide presence with the opening of its new dedicated Suzuki showroom in Kandy.\n\nLocated at No. 448, Katugasthota Road, Kandy, the new facility marks a significant milestone for the brand as the second dedicated Suzuki showroom in Sri Lanka, following the flagship Suzuki showroom in Borella.\n\nThe expansion reflects AMW\u2019s continued commitment to making Suzuki\u2019s globally renowned vehicles and customer-centric services more accessible to the customers across the Central province.\n\nThe ceremonial opening was attended by AMW Managing Director Jawahar Ganesh, AMW Sales Director Prasanna De Siva, members of the AMW management team, valued customers, business partners and other distinguished guests.\n\nThe new showroom showcases Suzuki\u2019s popular passenger vehicle line-up, including Grand Vitara, Jimny, Fronx, Celerio and Alto K10, providing the customers with the opportunity to explore the latest models and experience Suzuki\u2019s innovation, quality and reliability firsthand. The customers purchasing through AMW Suzuki benefit from a comprehensive ownership experience backed by a three-year or 100,000 km bumper-to-bumper warranty, access to genuine Suzuki parts and accessories and expert after-sales care delivered by Suzuki-trained technicians.\n\nTo further enhance customer convenience in the Central province, the owners can also access comprehensive after-sales support at AMW Pitstop \u2013 Kandy, located at No. 334/1, Yatiwawala, Katugastota, Kandy, offering vehicle servicing, repairs and body shop facilities."
