    "chunk_size_bytes": 1897,
    "chunk_text": "DIMO Mega Fiesta Kurunegala brings together over 400 Tata commercial vehicles\n\nDIMO Mega Fiesta Kurunegala 2026, a large-scale regional customer engagement programme, was successfully completed recently on the DIMO Kurunegala branch premises.\n\nDesigned to support the long-term performance of commercial vehicles, the five-day initiative brought together over 400 Tata commercial vehicle owners and operators from Kurunegala and surrounding regions.\n\nKurunegala, one of Sri Lanka\u2019s key commercial and agricultural hubs, was selected as the venue due to its strong concentration of Tata commercial vehicle customers engaged in transportation, logistics, construction and agriculture. The campaign provided the customers with convenient access to DIMO\u2019s after-sales expertise while strengthening relationships with the regional Tata commercial vehicle community.\n\nDIMO Chief Operating Officer Automotive Engineering Solutions Mahesh Karunaratne said, \u201cFor many commercial vehicle owners, their vehicle is more than just a mode of transport; it is their livelihood. DIMO Mega Fiesta was designed to offer a complete support platform where the customers can access expert technical advice, genuine parts, financial solutions and well-being initiatives, all in one place. This initiative reflects our commitment to being the perfect partner for our customers throughout their ownership journey.\u201d\n\nThe campaign offered free bumper-to-bumper vehicle inspections and detailed technical reports conducted by Tata Motors-trained technicians, enabling the customers to identify potential concerns and receive professional recommendations on maintenance and repairs.\n\nThe customers also benefited from free engine oil, brake oil and coolant top-ups, along with special discounts of up to 50 percent on Tata Genuine Parts, helping them maintain vehicle performance and minimise unexpected repair costs."
  },
