    "md5": "79bbc13ac576cebe8fce513d934d5e3e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 974,
    "chunk_text": "GoodWe has been trusted in Sri Lanka for 13 years, delivering reliable products, localised service and continuous innovation. To better serve the customers in Sri Lanka, GoodWe has established a nationwide localised service network and an extensive dealer network; it helps ensure timely and efficient support for the customers.\n\nAs part of the forum, GoodWe showcased its latest residential and C&I energy storage portfolio, highlighting the company\u2019s continued product innovation. The featured solutions included Lynx U G3 paired with ES Uniq, the ET LV series and Lynx A G4. Built around GoodWe\u2019s innovative CoreLock concept, these solutions seamlessly integrate the battery and inverter into a unified, one-stop energy storage system.\n\nThe second edition of the Solar + Storage Forum marked another step in strengthening collaboration between the government, industry and technology providers, supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s vision of a greener, more energy-secure future."
