    "chunk_text": "He described the partnership with Scope Cinemas as a significant step in the development\u2019s efforts to expand its lifestyle and entertainment offering.\n\nThe cinema operator said the multiplex would combine new screening technology with premium hospitality and curated entertainment.\n\nScope Cinemas was announced as an anchor tenant at an event held on Wednesday alongside the Sri Lankan premiere of \u2018Spider-Man: Brand New Day\u2019. The Shoppes, which partnered with the cinema operator for the premiere, also staged what it described as Sri Lanka\u2019s first Spider-Man-inspired drone show.\n\nThe new multiplex forms part of The Shoppes\u2019 broader expansion within City of Dreams Sri Lanka, which has been developed as an integrated destination spanning hospitality, retail, dining and entertainment."
