    "chunk_text": "Siddhalepa Ayurveda products and health resort honoured with prestigious GlobalHealth Sri Lanka Awards 2026\n\nSiddhalepa Ayurveda product range and Siddhalepa Ayurveda Health Resort have been honoured with two prestigious accolades at the inaugural GlobalHealth Asia-Pacific Sri Lanka Conference and Awards 2026. Siddhalepa Ayurveda products received the \u201cExcellence in Herbal Wellness and Functional Nutrition in Sri Lanka\u201d award, while Siddhalepa Ayurveda Health Resort was recognised as the \u201cHolistic Health and Wellness Service Provider of the Year in Sri Lanka.\u201d\n\nThe awards were presented during the GlobalHealth Sri Lanka Awards Gala held at ITC Ratnadipa, Colombo, on 21 July 2026. The event brought together regional healthcare leaders, policymakers, clinical experts, and wellness professionals to celebrate excellence, ethics, and innovation across the healthcare and wellness sectors through a rigorous nomination-only evaluation process led by an esteemed international and local jury.\n\nGlobalHealth Asia-Pacific is a premier regional platform dedicated to connecting healthcare providers, aesthetic centres, wellness destinations, and policymakers across more than 14 countries. The GlobalHealth Sri Lanka Awards celebrate organisations that uphold the highest standards of professional practice, ethical governance, service excellence, and patient-centred innovation.\n\nThe recognition awarded to Siddhalepa Ayurveda products celebrates more than nine decades of pioneering authentic Ayurvedic healthcare through herbal products that have become synonymous with trust, quality, and natural healing. Built upon Sri Lanka\u2019s rich indigenous Ayurvedic knowledge and refined through generations of expertise, research, and innovation, the Siddhalepa Ayurveda product range has brought the benefits of authentic Ayurveda into the daily lives of consumers in Sri Lanka and across the world."
