    "chunk_text": "Participants also took part in thematic discussions focusing on developing future-ready digital skills, strengthening innovation and support for independent professionals, expanding global market access, and improving policies, investments and infrastructure needed for sustainable growth.\n\nThe Government said the roadmap is expected to provide an evidence-based framework to improve the international competitiveness of Sri Lanka\u2019s digital industry, create quality employment and entrepreneurship opportunities, expand exports of locally developed digital products and services, and position the country as a leading digital economy in the region.\n\nThe roadmap will be further refined based on the recommendations made during the workshop, with the next phase focusing on the preparation of an integrated action plan outlining priority initiatives, responsible institutions, implementation timelines and progress indicators."
