    "chunk_size_bytes": 1850,
    "chunk_text": "City of Dreams celebrates one year of redefining Colombo\u2019s hospitality and entertainment landscape\n\nCinnamon Life at City of Dreams Sri Lanka, redefining Colombo\u2019s hospitality and lifestyle landscape\n\nIndiya, serving authentic regional Indian cuisine with a modern touch\n\nDreams & Beats, a vibrant poolside bar with music and live entertainment\n\nCity of Dreams Sri Lanka marks its first anniversary on 2nd August 2026, celebrating a milestone that has reshaped Sri Lanka\u2019s tourism, hospitality and lifestyle landscape.\n\nThe opening of South Asia\u2019s first fully integrated resort represented one of the country\u2019s most significant tourism developments, introducing an entirely new destination concept that seamlessly brings together luxury accommodation, world-class dining, entertainment, retail and lifestyle experiences within a single integrated resort. Following widespread anticipation ahead of its launch, City of Dreams Sri Lanka has established itself as a vibrant destination that continues to enhance Colombo\u2019s appeal for leisure, business and entertainment.\n\nThroughout its first year, City of Dreams Sri Lanka has established itself as one of the country\u2019s leading lifestyle destinations, welcoming local and international guests through an integrated resort experience unlike any other in Sri Lanka. Large-scale MICE events, international conferences, destination weddings, global entertainment performances and landmark celebrations have transformed the destination into a vibrant hub for business, leisure and social occasions. International chef collaborations, signature restaurant experiences and destination dining concepts have further enriched Colombo\u2019s culinary landscape, while international partnerships have strengthened Sri Lanka\u2019s appeal among regional and international travellers, particularly from India."
