    "description": "Allianz Lanka expands road safety campaign to Kurunegala and Kuliyapitiya",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Allianz-Lanka-expands-road-safety-campaign-to-Kurunegala-and-Kuliyapitiya/273-347112",
    "lang": "en",
