    "chunk_text": "These achievements reflect the bank\u2019s ability to pursue sustainable growth without compromising portfolio quality, supported by a robust risk management framework, sound governance and a customer-centric culture.\n\nThe bank has also maintained a consistent track record of profitability while declaring successive dividends over the last eight years.\n\nA key milestone in the bank\u2019s journey has been the continued confidence placed in it by the Islamic Development Bank (IsDB) group, which remains Am\u00e3na Bank\u2019s main strategic shareholder through its private sector arm, Islamic Corporation of the Development of the Private Sector (ICD).\n\nDespite Sri Lanka not being a member state of the IsDB group, its investment in Am\u00e3na Bank stands as a globally recognised success story, demonstrating how ethical, value-based banking can thrive in a diversified market while contributing meaningfully to national development.\n\nAm\u00e3na Bank has received numerous local and international accolades in recognition of its progress \u2013 from being named the Best Up and Coming Islamic Bank in the World by Global Finance Magazine USA during its formative years, to more recently being ranked amongst the World\u2019s Top 50 Strongest Islamic Banks by The Asian Banker and honoured as the Most Impactful ICD Investee Company by the Islamic Development Bank Group amongst 30+ global investee companies."
