    "chunk_text": "The students will also receive educational books, school supplies and other items they need\u00a0 for their studies.\n\nThe day will conclude with the \u2018Nena Isura\u2019 Scholarship Awards Ceremony from 2:00 p.m. to 3:30 p.m. at the Conference Hall, Temple Trees.\n\nA new group of selected students will also receive scholarships on this occasion.\n\nAmbassadors, high commissioners, internationally recognised guests, education officials, government officials, students, parents, devotees, donors and other invited guests are expected to attend the ceremony.\n\nThis program is not only about remembering Podi Hamuduruwo. It is also about\u00a0 continuing the work that was closest to his heart.\n\nEvery child who receives an education through \u2018Nena Isura\u2019 carries a part of his vision forward. In this way, the service and legacy of Podi Hamuduruwo will continue for many years to come."
