    "chunk_text": "Man injured in Rathmalana shooting\n\nColombo, August 1 (Daily Mirror) - A man was injured in a shooting incident reported on Kandawala Road in Rathmalana this afternoon.\n\nAccording to the police, two unidentified gunmen who arrived on a motorcycle opened fire at an individual inside a three-wheeler before fleeing the scene.\n\nThe injured victim was admitted to the Colombo South Teaching Hospital in Kalubowila for treatment."
