    "description": "Reckless motorcyclists continue to endanger lives on Sri Lanka\u2019s roads",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/reckless-motorcyclists-continue-to-endanger-lives-on-sri-lankas-roads/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
