    "chunk_text": "My father said that he heard about Nihal\u2019s promise to Brother Cassian to become a priest. He wanted to know my view on becoming a priest. I told him I would consider the possibility if there is a guarantee that I could become a bishop. He liked that answer and told my mother,\n\nMy mother laughed and said, \u201cYes, he is thinking of going abroad for higher studies and finding a suitable girl as his partner. You do not have to worry about him getting entangled with a girl in this area.\u201d\n\nA Tribute to Sir Christopher Ondaatje \u2013 A Diagonal Journey across Sri Lanka\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
