    "chunk_text": "One sky for all\n\nThe Association for the Intellectually Disabled, an umbrella organization representing 60 affiliated institutions, hosted the Kite Festival 2026 under the theme 'One Sky for All'. The annual event aims to foster joy, inclusion and community spirit among children with intellectual disabilities by providing a safe and enjoyable space to experience kite flying, music and friendship. The festival was held on Sunday at Galle Face Green."
