    "chunk_text": "Mehr News Agency quoted officials as describing the claim as \u201canother lie\u201d and an attempt to pressure Gulf countries through threats.\n\nThe officials said Iran\u2019s armed forces remained at the \u201chighest level of readiness\u201d and were prepared for any scenario.\n\nIranian Foreign Minister Abbas Araghchi reiterated Tehran\u2019s readiness to respond to any US or Israeli military action during a phone call with Saudi Foreign Minister Prince Faisal bin Farhan on Saturday.\n\nAraghchi said Iran was prepared to defend its sovereignty, territorial integrity and national security, adding that any aggression would face a \u201cdecisive and proportionate response\u201d from Iranian forces."
