    "chunk_text": "Toyota Lanka unveils all-new Toyota Hilux and Toyota RAV4 2026\n\nFrom left: Naotaka Takeda (Head \u2013 Value Chain), Masaaki Kawabata (Chairman), Manohara Atukorala (Chief Operating Officer), and Mathisha Samaranayake (Chief Operating Officer) of Toyota Lanka.\n\nToyota Lanka, the sole authorized distributor of Toyota Brand New Vehicles in Sri Lanka, officially unveiled the All-New Toyota Hilux and All-New Toyota RAV4 2026 at its exclusive launch event, \u2018Unlocked\u2019 held at Toyota Plaza, Wattala.\n\nThe grand unveiling welcomed over 250 business partners, industry stakeholders, customers, and media representatives, celebrating another significant milestone in Toyota Lanka\u2019s journey of delivering world-class mobility solutions to Sri Lankan customers.\n\nThe launch of the Toyota Hilux and Toyota RAV4 further strengthens Toyota Lanka\u2019s product portfolio with two iconic and innovative models that have earned global recognition for their performance and dependability.\n\nThis milestone event, celebrating the launch of the Toyota Hilux and Toyota RAV4, provided an excellent opportunity for stakeholders to experience Toyota\u2019s renowned reliability and the latest Toyota innovations designed to meet the evolving needs of Sri Lankan customers. Both models have been tropicalized to suit the country\u2019s diverse geographical and driving conditions, offering exceptional performance, safety, and versatility.\n\nThe RAV4, the best-selling SUV in the United States, continues to embody modern SUV comfort, advanced innovation, and everyday practicality, while the Hilux builds on Toyota\u2019s legendary reputation for strength, durability, and outstanding performance, making it the trusted choice for commercial mobility needs."
  },
