    "description": "HNB Life rings CSE market opening bell celebrating 25 years",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/HNB-Life-rings-CSE-market-opening-bell-celebrating-25-years/273-347203",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1785696232.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-08-03-dailymirrorlk-dc658edb-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "280ae8dee879a84a08ba83566fc43ea8",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1768,
    "chunk_text": "HNB Life rings CSE market opening bell celebrating 25 years\n\nHighlights from bell ringing ceremony to celebrate 25th anniversary of HNB Life\n\nHNB Life PLC marked its 25th anniversary with a special market opening bell ringing ceremony at the Colombo Stock Exchange (CSE), celebrating a remarkable journey defined by the commitment to protecting the lives and aspirations of Sri Lankans.\n\nThe ceremony brought together HNB Life\u2019s board of directors, executive committee, management and distinguished guests, alongside CSE Chairman Dimuthu Abeyesekera, CEO Rajeeva Bandaranaike and members of the CSE senior management, to celebrate a milestone that reflects not only the company\u2019s longevity but also its evolution into one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading life insurers.\n\nSince its inception as HNB Assurance 25 years ago, the company has evolved to meet the changing needs of Sri Lankans. Today, as HNB Life, it enters a new chapter with a refreshed identity that reflects both its heritage and future ambitions. More than a change of name, the transformation reinforces HNB Life\u2019s singular focus on life insurance and its commitment to helping every Sri Lankan build a financially secure future with confidence.\n\nSpeaking at the occasion, HNB Life and HNB General Insurance Chairman Stuart Chapman said, \u201cTwenty-five years is far more than a milestone. It represents the confidence that generations of customers, employees, shareholders and business partners have placed in HNB Life. Every chapter of our journey has been shaped by that trust. As we celebrate this occasion and our evolution into HNB Life, we also reaffirm our commitment to building an even stronger, more future-ready organisation that continues to create lasting value for all our stakeholders.\u201d"
