    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka Debaters Make History at World Schools Debating Championship\n\nColombo, Aug. 3 (Daily Mirror) - National team ranks 1st out of over 80 countries after preliminary rounds\n\nSri Lanka's national schools debating team has delivered the finest performance in the country's history at the World Schools Debating Championship (WSDC), the largest and most prestigious debating competition for secondary school students in the world.At WSDC 2026, held in Nairobi, Kenya from 14 to 24 July with the participation of more than 700 students, coaches and judges from over 80 countries,."
