    "chunk_text": "Colombo\u2013Kandy road closed between Kadugannawa and Ganethenna\n\nColombo, Aug. 3 (Daily Mirror) - The Colombo\u2013Kandy main road has been temporarily closed between Kadugannawa and Ganethenna due to the risk of rocks sliding onto the roadway, Police said.\n\nAs such, motorists have been urged to use alternative routes until further notice as a precautionary measure.\n\nPolice also advised drivers to follow traffic instructions and avoid the affected stretch until the road is declared safe for travel. Pic by\u00a0Ranjith Rajapaksa"
