    "chunk_text": "Nuwara Eliya schools to remain closed tomorrow due to bad weather\n\nColombo, Aug. 3 (Daily Mirror) - All government schools in the Nuwara Eliya District will be closed tomorrow (04) owing to severe weather conditions, according to the Director of the Nuwara Eliya Education Division.\n\nThe Education Division said further instructions regarding the resumption of academic activities will be issued by the relevant authorities if required."
