    "description": "ReturnShip Alliance launches Sri Lanka\u2019s first Returnship ecosystem",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/ReturnShip-Alliance-launches-Sri-Lankas-first-Returnship-ecosystem/273-347282",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1785779336.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-08-03-dailymirrorlk-6a329088-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "81c3adacdf35da3d48fd05fb54420008",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1723,
    "chunk_text": "ReturnShip Alliance launches Sri Lanka\u2019s first Returnship ecosystem\n\nStanding (from left): Shivalatha Sivasundaram (CEO/Founder - The Training Lab Pvt Ltd), Sahan Delduwa (Co-Founder S R S Business Solutions Pvt Ltd), Rizmi Marzook (Director \u2013 Techinno Solutions Lanka). Seated: Shiraz Safaideen (Independent Consultant) and Janani Liyanage (Co Founder: Business Agility Tune Up)\n\nThe Training Lab Pvt. Ltd announced the launch of ReturnShip Alliance, Sri Lanka\u2019s first holistic ReturnShip ecosystem, built to reconnect skilled professionals who have stepped away from mainstream employment with meaningful, flexible work \u2013 while giving Sri Lanka\u2019s micro- and small-to-medium enterprises (SMEs) access to affordable, high-quality back-office support.\n\nReturnShip Alliance is built around a simple but powerful idea: talent doesn\u2019t disappear when someone takes a career break. Carers, retired professionals, confident differently-abled individuals, and others who have faced barriers to conventional employment often carry deep expertise that goes unused simply because the traditional workplace wasn\u2019t built to accommodate their circumstances. ReturnShip Alliance is designed to change that.\n\nAt the heart of the model are Pods: small, accountable teams of four to five professionals who work together to deliver outsourced and fractional back-office services, such as finance, administration, and operational support, to client businesses. Each pod is guided by a pod lead, who manages the client relationship and ensures consistent, professional delivery. This structure allows individuals to re-enter the workforce on flexible terms, without sacrificing the accountability and quality that businesses need."
  },
