    "chunk_size_bytes": 833,
    "chunk_text": "\u201cFrom a technology and operations standpoint, our focus has been on building a stack that lets Pods function seamlessly so professionals can concentrate on delivering great work for clients rather than wrestling with tools,\u201d said Shiraz Safaideen, an independent consultant who leads the technology stack and broader operational support behind ReturnShip Alliance. \u201cWe\u2019ve designed the backend to scale with the model, from the first cohort in Sri Lanka right through to the franchise-style expansion planned ahead.\u201d\n\nThe launch marks the first phase of a broader roadmap. The Training Lab Pvt Ltd plans to prove the model in Sri Lanka before expanding internationally, with a long-term vision of scaling through a franchise-style licensing model that brings the ReturnShip Alliance approach to new markets around the world."
