    "md5": "3f01c3338836e506d724f6bd62e02418",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1728,
    "chunk_text": "CEAT Kelani accelerates partner power at \u2018Autobahn 3.0\u2019 Excellence Awards\n\nCEAT\u2019s Top 10 dealers in Sri Lanka with the Chairman, members of the board of directors and representatives of the senior management of CEAT Kelani Holdings\n\nCEAT Kelani Holdings recently celebrated the strength, resilience and success of its country-wide partner network at its Partner Excellence Awards 2026.\n\nCentred on the bold theme \u2018Autobahn 3.0\u2019, the event reflected the company\u2019s strategic focus on advanced mobility, superior product performance and global quality standards.\n\nInspired by Germany\u2019s legendary high-speed highway, the theme symbolised the precision, control and comfort that define CEAT\u2019s German-engineered car radials, while underscoring the company\u2019s transformation towards next-generation tyre technology across categories.\n\nThe celebration hosted 125 top dealers, 16 growth dealers, seven two- and three-wheeler distributors and their families, and two global partners of CEAT Kelani alongside the company\u2019s sales, marketing and export teams, in what was described as a memorable showcase of collaboration and excellence.\n\nAddressing the gathering, CEAT Kelani Chairman Chanaka de Silva paid tribute to the pivotal role played by dealers in sustaining the brand\u2019s growth in a challenging year.\n\n\u201cWe all know the past year brought its fair share of unpredictable weather and global chaos,\u201d he said. \u201cYet, every time a customer walked into your shops looking for safety, reliability, and honest advice, you supported CEAT. You are the ones who build trust in our name, day in and day out. Our growth over this past year has been a direct result of your hard work and your dedication,\u201d he stressed,"
  },
