    "language": "en",
    "md5": "751ab4a4006afe1261b267832346e629",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1863,
    "chunk_text": "Roar Global named an OpenAI Select Partner\n\nRoar Global, a venture builder in marketing technology and AI across the Asia-Pacific region, announced that it has been named an OpenAI Select Partner within the OpenAI Partner Network.\n\nThe OpenAI Partner Network is a global programme for partners to build, sell and deliver AI solutions with OpenAI. It brings together partners with deep industry expertise, delivery capabilities and customer relationships while equipping them with resources, enablement and support to help enterprises adopt OpenAI frontier models and products and turn them into measurable impact.\n\nAs an OpenAI Select Partner, Roar Global will continue working with OpenAI to help organisations build, deploy and scale AI solutions responsibly and effectively. This work will help organisations get more useful work from every token and stronger performance per dollar with GPT\u20115.6, while using ChatGPT Work to turn ambitious goals into finished work.\n\nRoar Global combines deep expertise across platform advertising, the creator economy and enterprise AI integration within a single group. From driving growth across the world\u2019s leading digital platforms to building AI infrastructure, automation and enterprise solutions, the company helps businesses translate emerging technology into measurable commercial advantage.\n\n\u201cBeing named an OpenAI Select Partner recognises the execution capability our teams already bring to clients across digital platforms, content and AI-led growth. It also marks an important step in our ambition to become a trusted infrastructure and integration partner for enterprises adopting AI across Sri Lanka and the wider Asia-Pacific region. This partnership strengthens our ability to turn that ambition into meaningful business outcomes,\u201d said Roar Global Founder and Chief Executive Officer Mustafa Kassim."
  },
