    "description": "Controversy over extension of judges\u2019 retirement age: Rage Over Age: the Need for Comprehensive Reform",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Controversy-over-extension-of-judges-retirement-age-Rage-Over-Age-the-Need-for-Comprehensive-Reform/172-347304",
