    "description": "Overreacting to student anger during India\u2019s \u2018Cockroach\u2019 Protests",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Overreacting-to-student-anger-during-Indias-Cockroach-Protests/172-347305",
