    "description": "President meets Tamil and Muslim political alliance, says committed to abolishing Executive Presidency",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/President-meets-Tamil-and-Muslim-political-alliance-says-committed-to-abolishing-Executive-Presidency/56-795566",
    "lang": "en",
