    "chunk_text": "Opposition calls for select committee to look into clearing of court cases backlog\n\nColombo, August 4 (Daily Mirror)- The Opposition today called for the appointment of a select committee to look into ways and means to clear the current backlog of court cases.\n\nThe written request was handed over to the Speaker by Leader of the Opposition Sajith Premadasa and several MPs."
