    "chunk_size_bytes": 1327,
    "chunk_text": "CDB wins NBEA Overall Excellence Silver\n\nAlso adjudged First Runner-Up in Extra-Large Sector Category and Winner in NBFI Sector\n\nNine years of consecutive sector leadership benchmarks sustained business excellence\n\nEtching a defining moment in its journey of excellence, Citizens Development Business Finance PLC (CDB) was crowned with the Silver award for Overall Excellence at the recently held National Business Excellence Awards 2026 (NBEA).\n\nBeing presented this landmark recognition underscores CDB\u2019s stature as one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most trusted and consistently high-performing business entity.\n\nAdding to this historic win, CDB was also adjudged Winner in the Non-Banking Financial Services Sector for a record nine consecutive years and First Runner-Up in the Extra-Large Sector Category. Together, these accolades exemplify CDB\u2019s dynamic leadership in business excellence and its overarching commitment to innovation, sustainability and governance.\n\n\u201cWe feel immensely elated with this achievement,\u201d said Deputy CEO Damith Thennakoon.\n\n\u201cIt is an absolutely momentous milestone in CDB\u2019s journey because for nine consecutive years we led our sector and now this recognition affirms our strength across every dimension of business excellence, from leadership and governance, performance to sustainability.\u201d"
