    "description": "Sri Lankans working in India can continue Sri Lanka EPF contributions",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Sri-Lankans-working-in-India-can-continue-Sri-Lanka-EPF-contributions/273-347403",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
