    "description": "Mahanayake Theras oppose proposed judicial retirement age amendment: BASL President",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Mahanayake-Theras-oppose-proposed-judicial-retirement-age-amendment-BASL-President/56-795614",
    "lang": "en",
