    "description": "Joint Opposition raises alarm over proposed Anti-Corruption Amendment Bill",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Joint-Opposition-raises-alarm-over-proposed-Anti-Corruption-Amendment-Bill/56-795620",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
