    "chunk_text": "Parliament unanimously approves salary increment of Auditor General\n\nColombo, Aug. 5 (Daily Mirror) - Parliament approved the salary increment of the Auditor General today.\n\nAccordingly, the salary of the Auditor General will be similar to that of a Ministry Secretary.\n\nThe proposal was approved by the Parliamentary Committee on Public Finance (CoPF) on Tuesday."
