    "chunk_text": "Ashraf said more than 1,500 secondary schools, mainly in remote and underserved areas, still lack computer laboratories. These schools will receive fully equipped computer labs, including computers, networking facilities and furniture, next year.\n\nIn addition, more than 500 schools without functioning computers and around 100 divisional education offices were provided with operational computer equipment last year.\n\nCongratulating the students who received laptops, Ashraf described their academic achievements as an important milestone and assured them that the Government would continue supporting their education and development."
