    "chunk_text": "Singer Sri Lanka and Fairfirst Insurance launch Sri Lanka\u2019s first in-store motor insurance solution\n\nSinger Sri Lanka PLC and Fairfirst Insurance Ltd. have partnered to introduce a breakthrough insurance experience in Sri Lanka by making motor insurance services available directly through Singer showrooms across the island.\n\nThis collaboration offers customers greater convenience, enabling them to purchase motor insurance seamlessly by simply scanning a QR code at their nearest Singer branch, supported by digitally enabled systems.\n\nAvailable through Singer\u2019s network of more than 425 showrooms, the service is designed to deliver a faster, simpler, and more transparent customer experience by reducing paperwork and streamlining the overall process.The partnership combines Fairfirst\u2019s customer-focused insurance expertise with Singer\u2019s unmatched retail reach, creating greater accessibility to trusted insurance solutions for customers nationwide.\n\nThe collaboration is set to bridge gaps in accessibility by extending motor insurance services beyond traditional urban touchpoints and into communities across the country where such services may not always be easily accessible. Through Singer\u2019s strong presence across Sri Lanka, customers can now conveniently explore and access motor insurance solutions within familiar retail spaces in their own localities.\n\nCommenting on the partnership, Singer Sri Lanka PLC Group Managing Director Mahesh Wijewardene said, \u201cSinger has always focused on making essential products and services more accessible to Sri Lankans. This partnership with Fairfirst allows us to expand the value we offer customers by transforming our showroom network into a broader service platform that goes beyond retail. It also creates greater convenience for customers while strengthening engagement across our branch network.\u201d"
  },
