    "md5": "488b6e47f17dfab087e3f18f3382f9c2",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1691,
    "chunk_text": "LOLC Finance crowned Sri Lanka\u2019s Most Loved Finance and Leasing Brand\n\nLOLC Finance has been recognized as the Reader\u2019s Most Loved Finance and Leasing Brand in the LMD Brands Annual 2026.\n\nThe recognition is based on an independent nationwide study conducted by PepperCube Consultants for LMD, capturing the opinions of consumers and business leaders across the country.\n\nOver the years, LOLC Finance has evolved well beyond the role of a conventional finance company. Today, it serves nearly 800,000 customers through a network of more than 200 branches, supported by digital platforms and agency channels that extend its reach across Sri Lanka.\n\nIts continued investment in digital innovation has also reshaped the customer experience. The recognition also reflects the company\u2019s resilience during a period of significant economic challenges. By maintaining responsible lending practices, safeguarding depositor confidence and remaining focused on long-term customer wellbeing, LOLC Finance has continued to strengthen its reputation as one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most dependable financial institutions.\n\nCommenting on the achievement, Krishan Thilakaratne, Director and Chief Executive Officer of LOLC Finance PLC, stated, \u201cBeing recognised as Sri Lanka\u2019s Most Loved Finance and Leasing Brand is both an honour and a profound responsibility. It is a testament to the trust our customers continue to place in us, not only to meet their financial needs, but also to support them through changing economic circumstances with responsibility, transparency, and care. This trust has always been the foundation of our success and continues to inspire us to raise the bar in everything we do."
  },
