    "md5": "61b02c70d584a9147522aa6df23df6b5",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 679,
    "chunk_text": "CCC\u2019s Motor Vehicle Industry Report returns after six-year hiatus\n\nThe Ceylon Chamber of Commerce (CCC) has revived its Motor Vehicle Industry Report after a six-year hiatus, reflecting the reopening of Sri Lanka\u2019s vehicle market, following the lifting of the import restrictions.\n\nThe Motor Vehicle Industry Report 2025/26 provides an overview of the sector, covering its economic contribution, policy developments, vehicle imports and registrations, ownership trends, global automotive developments and the growing role of artificial intelligence in the industry.\n\nIt is aimed at importers, assemblers, dealers, financial institutions, insurers, investors and policymakers."
