    "date_str": "2026-08-06",
    "description": "Shanakiyan raises concerns over water and land rights and illegal settlements",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Shanakiyan-raises-concerns-over-water-and-land-rights-and-illegal-settlements/56-795664",
