    "description": "EDB, IFC and EU launch third ExpoScaleUp cohort to boost Sri Lanka\u2019s SME export competitiveness",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/EDB-IFC-and-EU-launch-third-ExpoScaleUp-cohort-to-boost-Sri-Lanka-s-SME-export-competitiveness/34-795673",
