    "description": "Meta becomes latest firm to say its AI hacked another company",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Meta-becomes-latest-firm-to-say-its-AI-hacked-another-company/108-347580",
    "lang": "en",
