    "md5": "c3ec956a5d59978f9f26cc96eb02f051",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 750,
    "chunk_text": "Allianz Lanka certified as a Great Place to Work again\n\nAllianz Lanka has once again been recognised as a Great Place to Work in Sri Lanka, earning the prestigious certification for the third consecutive year.\n\nThe achievement reflects the company\u2019s continued commitment to building a workplace culture centred on trust, collaboration, innovation and employee well-being.\n\nThe globally recognised Great Place to Work certification is awarded based on employee feedback and evaluates workplace excellence across key areas including credibility, respect, fairness, pride and camaraderie.\n\nAchieving this distinction for three consecutive years reinforces Allianz Lanka\u2019s position as one of the leading employers in Sri Lanka\u2019s insurance industry."
