    "chunk_text": "By being present across key regions of the country, we have become part of the journey for many visitors exploring Sri Lanka. Our aim is to provide a consistent and memorable experience that contributes positively to their overall impression of the country.\n\nAt the heart of Barista\u2019s success is its focus on quality, innovation, financial discipline, customer experience and sustainable growth. The company continues to strengthen its operations, expand into new destinations and create welcoming spaces where people can connect over great coffee and food.\n\nTourism currently contributes approximately 20 percent of Barista\u2019s overall sales, demonstrating the important role international travellers play within the company\u2019s customer base and the relevance of a consistent caf\u00e9 network in supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s broader visitor experience.\n\nBarista extends its heartfelt gratitude to its customers, employees, franchise partners, suppliers and stakeholders whose continued trust, loyalty and support have made this achievement possible.\n\nWinning Gold for the second consecutive year represents another important milestone in Barista\u2019s journey as the company continues to grow responsibly, innovate boldly and contribute meaningfully to the future of Sri Lanka\u2019s hospitality and tourism sector."
