    "chunk_size_bytes": 1737,
    "chunk_text": "Cinnamon Box Office launches\n\nCinnamon Box Office (CBO), a strategic ticketing platform connecting audiences, event partners and world-class productions, was officially launched on August 6 at City of Dreams Sri Lanka, introducing a destination event calendar aimed at transforming Colombo into a regional hub for entertainment experiences.\n\nThe platform brings together entertainment, hospitality and tourism, creating new opportunities for audiences, event partners and Sri Lanka\u2019s creative economy through year-round cultural, lifestyle and entertainment experiences.\n\nBacked by more than a decade of experience in delivering entertainment and lifestyle events through Cinnamon Hotels & Resorts, Cinnamon Life and City of Dreams Sri Lanka, CBO combines expertise in ticketing, event access, hospitality and audience engagement.\n\nThe platform has previously supported a range of premium experiences, including Broadway productions such as Mamma Mia the Musical and The Sound of Music, culinary events featuring international personalities, knowledge forums, lifestyle events and celebrity-led experiences.\n\nAs part of its new destination event calendar, CBO will present \u201cThis Is Michael \u2013 Relive the Legend\u201d, an international tribute production celebrating the music and legacy of Michael Jackson. The show will be held on November 8 and 9, 2026, at The Podium, City of Dreams Sri Lanka.\n\nSpeaking at the launch, Cinnamon Hotels & Resorts Senior Vice President \u2013 Head of Corporate Communications and GAP, Dileep Mudadeniya, said CBO was more than a ticketing platform, describing it as an ecosystem connecting entertainment, hospitality and tourism while creating opportunities for Sri Lanka to host world-class productions."
