    "chunk_text": "Speaking at the launch, Cinnamon Hotels & Resorts Senior Vice President \u2013 Head of Corporate Communications and GAP, Dileep Mudadeniya, said CBO was more than a ticketing platform, describing it as an ecosystem connecting entertainment, hospitality and tourism while creating opportunities for Sri Lanka to host world-class productions.\n\nCBO said it has already generated over Rs. 400 million in revenue and facilitated more than 10,000 ticket sales, reflecting the growing demand for premium entertainment experiences in Sri Lanka.\n\nThrough Cinnamon Box Office, audiences will have access to internationally recognised productions and unique experiences, supporting Colombo\u2019s ambition to become a destination for culture, creativity and entertainment. Pix by Kithsiri De Mel"
