    "date_str": "2026-08-07",
    "description": "Meta fined $567m in largest child safety ruling against social media giant",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/international/Meta-fined-567m-in-largest-child-safety-ruling-against-social-media-giant/107-347628",
